### Major Changes in This Fork

#### Version 2.0.0 (December 31, 2025)
- Updated Baileys from 6.7.12 to 7.0.0-rc.9
- Migrated from CommonJS to ES Modules (ESM)
- Updated all dependencies to latest versions
- Added LID (Linked Device Identifiers) support
- Added Meta Coexistence support
- Improved error handling and logging
- Added health check endpoint
- Performance improvements (80% bundle size reduction)
- Enhanced security (reduced ban risk)

